# Binarios e SDKs de terceiros que nao sao codigo nosso nem dependencia do build:
# o programa carrega nvapi64.dll do driver da NVIDIA em tempo de execucao, e os
# zips de ADLX / display-library / LibreHardwareMonitor sao apenas referencia.
/ADLX-main/
/ADLX-main.zip
/nvapi-main/
/nvapi-main.zip
/display-library-18.0/
/drivers.gpu.control-library-master/
/gpu fan intel.zip
/LibreHardwareMonitor.zip
/LibreHardwareMonitor.exe
/LibreHardwareMonitor.exe.config
/amd-software-adrenalin-*.exe
/Setup.exe
/Bin64/
/Config/

